  "name": "components",
  "description": "A specialized library of Yew-based UI components for the Hades visualization platform, tailored for the Morpheus protocol. It provides high-level abstractions for rendering Directed Acyclic Graphs (DAGs), temporal sequence diagrams, and interactive block editors to facilitate deep inspection of protocol execution states. The system leverages Rust and WebAssembly to provide performant, reactive interfaces for debugging complex distributed process transitions and data flows.",
